WEBVTT

00:00:01.074 --> 00:00:03.033
[PHOENIX] During a spiritual
retreat, Maya's mother,

00:00:03.116 --> 00:00:04.699
Misty Fey, was murdered.

00:00:04.783 --> 00:00:06.741
The killing was motivated
by a power struggle

00:00:06.824 --> 00:00:08.283
within the Kurain school.

00:00:08.366 --> 00:00:11.366
A family torn apart by
jealousy and resentment.

00:00:11.449 --> 00:00:13.074
Although the motive is clear,

00:00:13.158 --> 00:00:15.699
we've yet to figure out who
stabbed the Master of Kurain

00:00:15.783 --> 00:00:17.533
near the snow-covered temple.

00:00:17.616 --> 00:00:19.824
But today, the
shocking truth will be revealed!

00:01:54.491 --> 00:01:55.908
Now, if you would, witness.

00:01:55.991 --> 00:01:58.199
Please state your name and
occupation for the court.

00:02:00.991 --> 00:02:02.658
My name is Maya Fey,

00:02:02.741 --> 00:02:05.158
assistant manager at
Wright and Company.

00:02:05.241 --> 00:02:06.449
We're a law office.

00:02:06.533 --> 00:02:07.658
On the night in question,

00:02:07.741 --> 00:02:09.533
you had been training
at the Inner Temple,

00:02:09.616 --> 00:02:12.116
where you witnessed the exact
moment of Misty Fey's death.

00:02:12.199 --> 00:02:13.741
[whimpers]

00:02:13.824 --> 00:02:15.574
But when the murder took place,

00:02:15.658 --> 00:02:18.616
there was another, unidentified
person on the scene.

00:02:18.699 --> 00:02:19.908
[gasps]

00:02:19.991 --> 00:02:22.283
Yes. That person
was the real killer.

00:02:22.366 --> 00:02:24.324
Uh. No, he was only trying to--

00:02:25.241 --> 00:02:26.866
[PHOENIX]
Hold on a minute.

00:02:26.949 --> 00:02:29.741
You said "he," so does
that mean you saw them?

00:02:29.824 --> 00:02:33.366
I didn't. And of course,
it was super dark that night.

00:02:33.449 --> 00:02:34.908
Dark is great for coffee.

00:02:34.991 --> 00:02:37.658
But not so good
for accurate testimony.

00:02:37.741 --> 00:02:39.824
He's right!
I could barely see a thing!

00:02:39.908 --> 00:02:41.616
[PHOENIX]
I'm not buying it.

00:02:41.699 --> 00:02:43.658
You called the
third person "he,"

00:02:43.741 --> 00:02:46.033
then stopped yourself
from speaking.

00:02:46.116 --> 00:02:48.158
That suggests
to me you recognized him.

00:02:48.241 --> 00:02:49.533
[gasps]

00:02:49.616 --> 00:02:51.033
And for some reason,
you seem to be trying to help

00:02:51.116 --> 00:02:52.283
him with a cover up.

00:02:52.366 --> 00:02:53.616
[MAYA whimpers]

00:02:53.699 --> 00:02:54.908
[JUDGE]
A cover up?

00:02:54.991 --> 00:02:57.283
What exactly are you
suggesting here, defense?

00:02:57.366 --> 00:02:59.158
[PHOENIX] It was dark
and cloudy that night,

00:02:59.241 --> 00:03:01.824
so she shouldn't have been able
to see the killer clearly.

00:03:01.908 --> 00:03:04.033
Still, she managed somehow.

00:03:05.324 --> 00:03:07.658
A person could've
easily hidden in the shadows.

00:03:07.741 --> 00:03:10.199
However, there are some things
that are easier to see

00:03:10.283 --> 00:03:11.324
in the dark!

00:03:12.449 --> 00:03:14.741
I like your grind, it's strong.

00:03:14.824 --> 00:03:16.658
But it's a little
hard to swallow.

00:03:16.741 --> 00:03:18.449
Can you show us what you mean?

00:03:18.533 --> 00:03:20.866
Please turn off all
the lights in the courtroom!

00:03:21.991 --> 00:03:24.158
[CROWD murmurin]

00:03:24.241 --> 00:03:25.699
[JUDGE]
Wait. Hold on.

00:03:25.783 --> 00:03:27.199
What is that?

00:03:29.408 --> 00:03:31.324
Well, you've gone
and done it now.

00:03:31.408 --> 00:03:32.824
Nicely played.

00:03:32.908 --> 00:03:34.991
So Maya, despite the darkness,

00:03:35.074 --> 00:03:37.158
you were able to see these
three lights, weren't you?

00:03:37.241 --> 00:03:38.324
[MAYA gasps]

00:03:40.783 --> 00:03:42.366
[MAYA]
No!

00:03:42.449 --> 00:03:45.616
Something's seemed off to me.
If you look at the crime scene.

00:03:45.699 --> 00:03:47.741
The most conspicuous and
seemingly damning piece

00:03:47.824 --> 00:03:50.324
of evidence is front and center.

00:03:50.408 --> 00:03:51.658
[gasps]

00:03:51.741 --> 00:03:53.616
A cover-up at this
stage seems fairly pointless,

00:03:53.699 --> 00:03:55.658
when something like this
is right out in front,

00:03:55.741 --> 00:03:56.866
so why even bother?

00:03:56.949 --> 00:03:58.533
Remember what happened
when this photograph

00:03:58.616 --> 00:04:00.324
was presented as evidence?

00:04:00.408 --> 00:04:01.908
Nonsense.

00:04:01.991 --> 00:04:03.741
You expect me to believe there's
something written on that thing?

00:04:03.824 --> 00:04:04.949
Oh.

00:04:05.033 --> 00:04:07.241
And a similar thing
happened once before.

00:04:07.324 --> 00:04:10.991
It was during the poisoning
case at Très Bien Bistro.

00:04:11.074 --> 00:04:13.116
Prosecutor Godot,
certain colors are

00:04:13.199 --> 00:04:14.616
all but invisible to you.

00:04:14.699 --> 00:04:16.158
[gasps]

00:04:16.241 --> 00:04:18.783
[PHOENIX] One, for example,
is red on a white background.

00:04:18.866 --> 00:04:21.866
That's why you cleared out so
much snow around the lantern.

00:04:23.783 --> 00:04:26.158
Why do I seem
to be the only one?

00:04:26.241 --> 00:04:28.408
Everyone else can see it but me.

00:04:30.033 --> 00:04:32.949
The defense will
now make a formal accusation.

00:04:33.033 --> 00:04:35.991
The person who killed Misty Fey,
was Prosecutor Godot!

00:04:36.074 --> 00:04:38.533
[CROWD gasping]

00:04:38.616 --> 00:04:41.991
Interesting brew, but how
do you make it palatable?

00:04:42.074 --> 00:04:45.408
A good reason to kill Misty Fey
might make it go down smoother.

00:04:45.491 --> 00:04:48.908
It's not as cut and dry
as just killing Misty Fey.

00:04:48.991 --> 00:04:51.991
You were saving a life.
Maya's, in fact!

00:04:53.741 --> 00:04:56.616
[GODOT]
Tch. This may sound bitter,

00:04:56.699 --> 00:04:59.741
but I'm really not as heroic as
you may be inclined to believe.

00:05:01.033 --> 00:05:03.533
I'm not the type of
guy to protect a stranger!

00:05:04.866 --> 00:05:07.574
Maya isn't some random
stranger to you, is she?

00:05:07.658 --> 00:05:08.741
Say what?

00:05:08.824 --> 00:05:10.241
Because after all...

00:05:10.324 --> 00:05:13.033
She happens to be the love
of your life's little sister.

00:05:13.116 --> 00:05:14.283
[MAYA whimpers]

00:05:16.824 --> 00:05:19.866
Mia Fey... My love...

00:05:19.949 --> 00:05:21.991
She's special to you...

00:05:22.074 --> 00:05:24.033
...Diego Armando.

00:05:26.741 --> 00:05:29.158
Did I hear
the defense correctly?

00:05:29.241 --> 00:05:30.824
Are you him?

00:05:30.908 --> 00:05:33.449
The last time somebody
called me by that name

00:05:33.533 --> 00:05:36.033
was over six years ago.

00:05:36.116 --> 00:05:38.366
[PHOENIX] This all goes
back to an infamous case.

00:05:38.449 --> 00:05:40.783
And a trial that ended in
the defendant's suicide

00:05:40.866 --> 00:05:42.408
in the courtroom.

00:05:42.491 --> 00:05:45.366
You stood beside Mia
as she made her arguments.

00:05:45.449 --> 00:05:47.658
But in the end, she was
unable to find proof

00:05:47.741 --> 00:05:50.283
of Dahlia Hawthorne's crimes.

00:05:50.366 --> 00:05:52.283
[GODOT]
After all that went down,

00:05:52.366 --> 00:05:55.158
we went over every detail of
that fake kidnapping case

00:05:55.241 --> 00:05:56.949
with a fine-toothed comb.

00:05:59.491 --> 00:06:00.533
[MIA gasps]

00:06:00.616 --> 00:06:02.366
[BOTH laugh]

00:06:07.324 --> 00:06:09.033
[GODOT] The way she treated
her clients came from

00:06:09.116 --> 00:06:10.908
her kind and pure heart.

00:06:14.574 --> 00:06:17.741
[GODOT]
I was captivated by her.

00:06:17.824 --> 00:06:19.658
We were still poring over
that case when I asked

00:06:19.741 --> 00:06:22.408
Dahlia Hawthorne to meet me at
the cafeteria right here

00:06:22.491 --> 00:06:23.658
in this courthouse.

00:06:27.324 --> 00:06:30.366
[GODOT] Next thing I knew,
I was going into a deep sleep.

00:06:33.283 --> 00:06:36.158
[GODOT] The poison I was given
did a real number on me.

00:06:36.241 --> 00:06:39.783
I lost my sight and my hair
turned as white as cream.

00:06:40.991 --> 00:06:43.074
[GODOT]
Five years later, I was awoken

00:06:43.158 --> 00:06:46.533
by the smell of fresh-brewed
coffee, and then,

00:06:46.616 --> 00:06:48.283
I got a real wake up call.

00:06:49.533 --> 00:06:52.699
[GODOT] The woman I loved
had been murdered.

00:06:52.783 --> 00:06:54.449
She was gone forever.

00:06:56.158 --> 00:06:58.158
And the woman I loathed
had been sentenced to die

00:06:58.241 --> 00:07:00.116
in the iron bar hotel.

00:07:01.283 --> 00:07:03.199
There was no way
I could go back to sleep.

00:07:03.283 --> 00:07:05.741
I had two things keeping me up.

00:07:05.824 --> 00:07:08.074
They're what drove me
to become a prosecutor.

00:07:08.158 --> 00:07:10.783
The first one, was you, Trite.

00:07:10.866 --> 00:07:11.991
Why me?

00:07:12.074 --> 00:07:14.241
Because you're the one
who let Mia Fey die!

00:07:14.324 --> 00:07:15.449
[gasps]

00:07:15.533 --> 00:07:16.574
[GODOT] She'd still
be alive if you weren't

00:07:16.658 --> 00:07:19.574
such an immature child!

00:07:19.658 --> 00:07:21.408
I wanted the whole
world to know what kind of

00:07:21.491 --> 00:07:23.408
a man you really were.

00:07:23.491 --> 00:07:25.408
And my other
reason to go on living?

00:07:25.491 --> 00:07:27.574
Was Maya Fey.

00:07:27.658 --> 00:07:30.408
She was the only way
I could atone for the sin

00:07:30.491 --> 00:07:33.074
of not being there for Mia.

00:07:33.158 --> 00:07:35.366
After the incident
in Kurain Village last year,

00:07:35.449 --> 00:07:37.449
Morgan Fey was arrested.

00:07:37.533 --> 00:07:40.824
But it was obvious she'd
still be plotting something.

00:07:40.908 --> 00:07:42.491
I listened to
the conversations she had

00:07:42.574 --> 00:07:45.866
with her visitors hoping
she'd let something slip.

00:07:45.949 --> 00:07:48.908
That's when I learned there
was actually a written plan.

00:07:48.991 --> 00:07:50.491
I found it before
Pearl could read

00:07:50.574 --> 00:07:52.616
its bone-chilling details.

00:07:52.699 --> 00:07:54.366
Instead of destroying
it right then and there,

00:07:54.449 --> 00:07:57.033
I thought playing along
might be a better strategy.

00:07:58.491 --> 00:08:02.491
[GODOT] If I could pull it off,
this would end once and for all.

00:08:02.574 --> 00:08:05.324
But I realized
I couldn't do it alone.

00:08:05.408 --> 00:08:07.824
So I asked for help from Iris,
because she would be there

00:08:07.908 --> 00:08:09.408
at Hazakura Temple.

00:08:09.491 --> 00:08:11.783
I also contacted Misty Fey.

00:08:12.949 --> 00:08:15.033
[GODOT] The police had been
keeping an eye on her movements

00:08:15.116 --> 00:08:18.658
since the DL-6
incident years ago.

00:08:18.741 --> 00:08:20.199
And due to my newfound position

00:08:20.283 --> 00:08:25.033
at the prosecutor's office,
I was able to access that info.

00:08:25.116 --> 00:08:28.491
Then finally,
the call came in from Iris.

00:08:28.574 --> 00:08:31.366
I rushed to the temple
as quickly as I could.

00:08:31.449 --> 00:08:33.491
The only way we
could stop their evil plan

00:08:33.574 --> 00:08:35.408
from happening,
was to make sure Pearl

00:08:35.491 --> 00:08:37.783
didn't channel Dahlia Hawthorne.

00:08:37.866 --> 00:08:39.991
[PHOENIX] I see, and that
must be the reason Misty

00:08:40.074 --> 00:08:43.241
invited little Pearl to come
up to her room that night.

00:08:43.324 --> 00:08:46.158
[GODOT] Unfortunately,
she never showed up.

00:08:46.241 --> 00:08:48.324
[PHOENIX] She went to
the Inner Temple instead.

00:08:48.408 --> 00:08:51.199
[GODOT] That's why Misty had
to channel Dahlia herself.

00:08:51.283 --> 00:08:55.283
Into her own body.
A risk she was forced to take.

00:08:55.366 --> 00:08:57.491
[PHOENIX] Because if she
channeled the spirit first,

00:08:57.574 --> 00:09:00.283
then Pearl wouldn't
be able to do it.

00:09:00.366 --> 00:09:02.658
[GODOT]
Still, if things went sideways,

00:09:02.741 --> 00:09:05.033
I would have to
stop Dahlia myself.

00:09:05.116 --> 00:09:06.991
So I hid over by
the inner temple.

00:09:08.741 --> 00:09:10.158
[GODOT]
Anyway...

00:09:10.241 --> 00:09:12.658
That's about all
I'm gonna say at this point.

00:09:12.741 --> 00:09:13.866
[gasps]

00:09:13.949 --> 00:09:16.283
[GODOT] There's just
one question remaining.

00:09:16.366 --> 00:09:18.658
We all want to know who
really killed Misty Fey

00:09:18.741 --> 00:09:19.949
at the Inner Temple.

00:09:20.033 --> 00:09:21.408
[CROWD gasping]

00:09:21.491 --> 00:09:22.574
[MAYA gasp]

00:09:22.658 --> 00:09:24.699
You got the answer, Trite?

00:09:24.783 --> 00:09:26.616
I thought you were
the real deal.

00:09:26.699 --> 00:09:29.699
So why don't you
show us your proof?

00:09:29.783 --> 00:09:31.533
Make it clear you
can finish this on your own!

00:09:31.616 --> 00:09:33.324
No, don't do it, Nick!

00:09:33.408 --> 00:09:35.616
Please don't. For me...

00:09:35.699 --> 00:09:37.408
Maya...

00:09:37.491 --> 00:09:40.116
Mia told me
the whole story earlier.

00:09:40.199 --> 00:09:41.866
He risked his life
for both of us.

00:09:41.949 --> 00:09:43.908
For my life and her memory!

00:09:43.991 --> 00:09:46.033
--I know!
--[MAYA gasps]

00:09:46.116 --> 00:09:47.783
[PHOENIX]
His motives may have been pure,

00:09:47.866 --> 00:09:50.116
but that doesn't
excuse what he did.

00:09:50.199 --> 00:09:52.074
I have a duty to find the truth!

00:09:52.158 --> 00:09:53.699
No matter the cost!

00:09:55.616 --> 00:09:58.491
The defense will now present
our very last piece of evidence.

00:09:58.574 --> 00:10:00.199
Look there!

00:10:00.283 --> 00:10:01.449
[JUDGE]
That dagger.

00:10:01.533 --> 00:10:03.033
It's the one Dahlia Hawthorne
was carrying,

00:10:03.116 --> 00:10:04.491
if I'm not mistaken.

00:10:04.574 --> 00:10:05.949
[PHOENIX]
Yes. And as you can see,

00:10:06.033 --> 00:10:07.533
the tip is covered in blood.

00:10:07.616 --> 00:10:08.908
But we had determined
that the sword

00:10:08.991 --> 00:10:10.616
was the murder weapon.

00:10:10.699 --> 00:10:13.533
The blood on that
matched the victim's.

00:10:13.616 --> 00:10:15.158
That's true, but why
is there a bloodstain

00:10:15.241 --> 00:10:16.574
on this dagger?

00:10:16.658 --> 00:10:18.324
The only possible answer...

00:10:18.408 --> 00:10:19.783
...is this.

00:10:19.866 --> 00:10:21.699
At the moment she was being
run through by the sword,

00:10:21.783 --> 00:10:25.324
Dahlia's reflexes kicked in,
and she struck them back.

00:10:25.408 --> 00:10:26.658
Is that so?

00:10:26.741 --> 00:10:29.491
Therefore... the blood
on the tip of this dagger,

00:10:29.574 --> 00:10:31.158
actually belongs
to the killer!

00:10:31.241 --> 00:10:33.033
--[CROWD gasping]
--[MAYA] Objection!

00:10:33.116 --> 00:10:34.991
But he couldn't go and get
a change of clothes or have

00:10:35.074 --> 00:10:36.699
his wounds treated that
night because the bridge

00:10:36.783 --> 00:10:37.991
had gone up in flames!

00:10:38.074 --> 00:10:40.741
Ah! Yeah, you're right.

00:10:40.824 --> 00:10:42.824
I was completely
trapped at the Inner Temple,

00:10:42.908 --> 00:10:45.949
which means I would have
had no way to hide my wound.

00:10:46.033 --> 00:10:48.074
What now, defense?

00:10:48.158 --> 00:10:49.491
How will you get around that?

00:10:49.574 --> 00:10:51.199
[PHOENIX yells]

00:10:53.199 --> 00:10:55.283
[JUDGE] You've made a very
serious charge of murder,

00:10:55.366 --> 00:10:56.616
Mister Wright.

00:10:56.699 --> 00:10:59.158
So you must realize that
the burden is on you now.

00:10:59.241 --> 00:11:01.366
If you have no proof
to back up this claim,

00:11:01.449 --> 00:11:03.074
I'm ready to deliver my verdict.

00:11:03.158 --> 00:11:04.783
[PHOENIX]
The judge is right.

00:11:04.866 --> 00:11:07.283
The burden is on
my shoulders alone.

00:11:08.491 --> 00:11:10.033
[PHOENIX]
There's simply no other choice.

00:11:10.116 --> 00:11:11.449
I have to prove it.

00:11:11.533 --> 00:11:13.741
Because just like
my mentor taught me,

00:11:13.824 --> 00:11:16.574
that's what a lawyer does!

00:11:16.658 --> 00:11:18.574
[PHOENIX]
Objection!

00:11:18.658 --> 00:11:19.824
I can prove it!

00:11:19.908 --> 00:11:21.283
You're trying to
play me for a fool,

00:11:21.366 --> 00:11:24.033
but I will gravely
sunder that plan!

00:11:24.116 --> 00:11:26.116
Not on your own you won't!

00:11:26.199 --> 00:11:27.991
You'll never do it without
her help and you'll never be

00:11:28.074 --> 00:11:29.866
half the lawyer she was!

00:11:32.199 --> 00:11:34.366
Is this really
for the best, Nick?

00:11:34.449 --> 00:11:36.241
I don't know...

00:11:36.324 --> 00:11:38.199
If we turn
our thinking around,

00:11:38.283 --> 00:11:41.533
it should be obvious why
there's no visible wound!

00:11:41.616 --> 00:11:43.533
Uh. Turn it... around?

00:11:43.616 --> 00:11:45.366
Instead of wondering
why there was no bloodstain

00:11:45.449 --> 00:11:49.158
on his clothing, we'll just
show everyone the wound...

00:11:49.241 --> 00:11:51.283
[BOTH] ...because I know
exactly where it is!

00:11:51.366 --> 00:11:53.158
[gasps]
Is that Mia?

00:11:53.241 --> 00:11:56.741
Yes! It's hidden in a place that
one would never think to look.

00:11:56.824 --> 00:11:59.283
--There.
--There.

00:11:59.366 --> 00:12:01.074
--Right beneath that mask!
--Right beneath that mask!

00:12:02.699 --> 00:12:03.824
[GODOT grunts]

00:12:06.324 --> 00:12:08.158
[GODOT whimpers]

00:12:08.241 --> 00:12:09.658
Prosecutor.

00:12:09.741 --> 00:12:12.116
I respectfully ask you
to remove your mask.

00:12:12.199 --> 00:12:14.699
If we find the mark
the dagger left...

00:12:14.783 --> 00:12:17.366
...we'll find the answer
to who killed Misty Fey!

00:12:20.241 --> 00:12:21.283
[GODOT grunts]

00:12:25.616 --> 00:12:26.949
[JUDGE]
Hmm?

00:12:27.033 --> 00:12:28.158
[MAYA gasps]

00:12:32.699 --> 00:12:35.033
We don't have
to go through all that.

00:12:35.116 --> 00:12:39.408
No. I saw her
spirit in you just now.

00:12:41.741 --> 00:12:45.574
When I started this journey,
I thought I'd never forgive you.

00:12:45.658 --> 00:12:46.949
Mister Godot...

00:12:47.033 --> 00:12:50.408
But now...
Turns out that I was wrong.

00:12:50.491 --> 00:12:51.908
And honestly...

00:12:51.991 --> 00:12:54.033
I've learned that I've been
wrong about a lot of things.

00:12:55.991 --> 00:12:58.533
And the only one
I can't forgive is myself.

00:12:58.616 --> 00:13:00.449
What makes you say that?

00:13:00.533 --> 00:13:01.658
When you boil it all down,

00:13:01.741 --> 00:13:04.283
I was the one who
didn't protect Mia.

00:13:04.366 --> 00:13:06.908
I truly failed her.

00:13:06.991 --> 00:13:09.241
I hid my face behind this mask.

00:13:09.324 --> 00:13:12.199
I got rid of my true name.

00:13:12.283 --> 00:13:15.366
I even walked away
from being a defense attorney.

00:13:15.449 --> 00:13:18.533
True, but don't forget
you were able to save Maya!

00:13:18.616 --> 00:13:21.741
Yeah, that's what
I thought, anyway.

00:13:21.824 --> 00:13:24.283
But I was really
just fooling myself.

00:13:24.366 --> 00:13:26.783
I wasn't actually
interested in saving anyone.

00:13:26.866 --> 00:13:29.616
Everything I did
was out of selfishness.

00:13:29.699 --> 00:13:30.949
I mean...

00:13:31.033 --> 00:13:34.033
All I really wanted to do
was heal my broken soul.

00:13:35.366 --> 00:13:36.783
I spent all this time
trying to make up for

00:13:36.866 --> 00:13:39.533
the fact that I couldn't
save Mia, but...

00:13:39.616 --> 00:13:42.408
That night, when I saw
that silhouette in the darkness

00:13:42.491 --> 00:13:44.533
of the temple garden,

00:13:44.616 --> 00:13:47.449
deep down, a part of me
must have known the truth.

00:13:50.449 --> 00:13:53.533
[GODOT] That it wasn't really
Dahlia Hawthorne standing there,

00:13:53.616 --> 00:13:54.908
it couldn't be.

00:13:54.991 --> 00:13:56.158
[MAYA gasps]

00:13:56.241 --> 00:13:58.074
She had been hanged.

00:13:58.158 --> 00:14:00.991
Misty Fey was just
channeling her spirit.

00:14:01.074 --> 00:14:04.033
But even so,
I still picked up the blade.

00:14:08.866 --> 00:14:10.241
[GODOT grunts]

00:14:10.324 --> 00:14:11.658
It's strange.

00:14:11.741 --> 00:14:13.783
I'm not entirely sure what
was going through my mind

00:14:13.866 --> 00:14:15.616
at that point.

00:14:15.699 --> 00:14:17.449
Was I simply being
driven by my desire

00:14:17.533 --> 00:14:19.491
to protect Maya Fey?

00:14:19.574 --> 00:14:20.824
Or maybe...

00:14:20.908 --> 00:14:22.408
...it was revenge.

00:14:22.491 --> 00:14:25.408
I could strike back at the woman
who'd taken everything from me.

00:14:27.866 --> 00:14:29.574
To be quite frank...

00:14:30.866 --> 00:14:32.616
...I really couldn't tell ya.

00:14:34.908 --> 00:14:38.741
[GODOT]
However, I am sure of one thing.

00:14:38.824 --> 00:14:42.658
It dawned on me today just
how arrogant I've become.

00:14:42.741 --> 00:14:45.783
You served me
a hot cup of fresh perspective.

00:14:45.866 --> 00:14:46.949
[PHOENIX grunts]

00:14:47.033 --> 00:14:49.199
[GODOT]
Unlike me, you were brave.

00:14:49.283 --> 00:14:52.533
You never ran from Mia's death.

00:14:52.616 --> 00:14:55.741
Instead, you took
the mantle as a true defender

00:14:55.824 --> 00:14:57.116
of the people.

00:14:57.199 --> 00:15:01.449
Once I realized that,
it all fell into place.

00:15:01.533 --> 00:15:04.449
Well. I guess
there's nothing left to say.

00:15:05.991 --> 00:15:07.658
Prosecutor Godot.

00:15:07.741 --> 00:15:10.949
He's gone.
I can't be him anymore.

00:15:11.033 --> 00:15:13.324
So from now on...

00:15:13.408 --> 00:15:16.741
...you can call me
Diego Armando.

00:15:16.824 --> 00:15:18.074
I just wanna say...

00:15:18.158 --> 00:15:20.616
Thank you, Mister Armando.

00:15:20.699 --> 00:15:23.574
If it weren't for you,
I wouldn't be alive right now.

00:15:23.658 --> 00:15:26.241
And I know if Mom
and Mia were still here,

00:15:26.324 --> 00:15:28.491
they would want
to thank you, too!

00:15:35.074 --> 00:15:37.699
Aw. I appreciate it.

00:15:37.783 --> 00:15:40.074
Your wound is really bleeding!

00:15:40.158 --> 00:15:41.908
Don't you remember?

00:15:41.991 --> 00:15:45.491
In my world, there's no
such color as blood red.

00:15:45.574 --> 00:15:47.449
This can only be...

00:15:47.533 --> 00:15:49.449
...me crying tears of relief.

00:15:51.283 --> 00:15:54.491
[GODOT] Ever since I woke up
in that hospital bed,

00:15:54.574 --> 00:15:58.616
I've been waiting for
this very moment to happen.

00:15:58.699 --> 00:16:01.741
When things seem like
they're the most hopeless,

00:16:01.824 --> 00:16:04.116
that's when we can laugh.

00:16:04.199 --> 00:16:06.741
And when everything is over,
it's time to cry.

00:16:11.241 --> 00:16:12.491
Very well, then.

00:16:12.574 --> 00:16:14.991
I suppose it is over this time.

00:16:15.074 --> 00:16:17.658
Defendant... Is there anything
you'd like to say

00:16:17.741 --> 00:16:19.574
before I hand down my verdict?

00:16:20.949 --> 00:16:23.366
As a matter of fact,
there's one thing.

00:16:23.449 --> 00:16:24.616
And it's to Mister Wright.

00:16:24.699 --> 00:16:26.074
[PHOENIX grunts]

00:16:26.158 --> 00:16:29.658
It's not easy, but I hope
you can forgive me someday.

00:16:29.741 --> 00:16:32.283
Forgive you? For what exactly?

00:16:32.366 --> 00:16:33.366
Well, for...

00:16:33.449 --> 00:16:34.908
Back then...

00:16:34.991 --> 00:16:37.824
Six years ago, when my twin
sister Dahlia tried to kill you.

00:16:39.324 --> 00:16:43.158
[gasps] Honestly,
even after all this time,

00:16:43.241 --> 00:16:45.574
I still can't believe it.

00:16:45.658 --> 00:16:48.616
I mean, the girl
I knew just wasn't like that.

00:16:48.699 --> 00:16:50.241
It's not surprising.

00:16:50.324 --> 00:16:53.699
Because in reality, the two of
you barely even knew each other.

00:16:53.783 --> 00:16:55.908
[gasps]
What do you mean by that?

00:16:55.991 --> 00:16:57.866
You and my twin sister

00:16:57.949 --> 00:17:00.116
actually only met
on two occasions.

00:17:00.199 --> 00:17:02.241
What? Twice?

00:17:02.324 --> 00:17:04.658
[IRIS] The first time was
here at the courthouse.

00:17:04.741 --> 00:17:06.658
And the other time
was on the day...

00:17:06.741 --> 00:17:08.741
...when Doug was murdered.

00:17:08.824 --> 00:17:11.241
Apart from those two times,
you never really interacted

00:17:11.324 --> 00:17:12.533
with her at all.

00:17:12.616 --> 00:17:14.283
I don't understand.

00:17:14.366 --> 00:17:16.824
[IRIS] Ever since she gave
you the bottle that day,

00:17:16.908 --> 00:17:20.033
her main goal was to get it back
from you however she could.

00:17:20.116 --> 00:17:21.866
And quickly.

00:17:21.949 --> 00:17:25.699
She considered you to be
a huge threat, so you had to go.

00:17:25.783 --> 00:17:28.491
I couldn't...
I just couldn't bear the thought

00:17:28.574 --> 00:17:30.908
of more sins
weighing on her soul.

00:17:30.991 --> 00:17:32.824
I begged her not to do it.

00:17:32.908 --> 00:17:34.574
--And she gave me a chance.
--[gasps]

00:17:34.658 --> 00:17:36.199
I promised her.

00:17:36.283 --> 00:17:38.824
I said I would be able to get
the pendant back from you.

00:17:38.908 --> 00:17:40.033
[gasps]

00:17:40.116 --> 00:17:43.324
I tried, but I just
didn't have it in me.

00:17:43.408 --> 00:17:45.408
You were so happy about
the gift you'd been given

00:17:45.491 --> 00:17:47.741
and the love you
thought it symbolized.

00:17:47.824 --> 00:17:49.158
This went on for six months,

00:17:49.241 --> 00:17:51.699
but I wasn't able
to get it back.

00:17:51.783 --> 00:17:54.283
Finally, she ran out of patience

00:17:54.366 --> 00:17:56.991
and committed
that terrible crime.

00:17:57.074 --> 00:17:58.616
She didn't even care
that I had developed

00:17:58.699 --> 00:18:00.408
real feelings for you.

00:18:01.783 --> 00:18:03.949
I let everybody down.

00:18:04.033 --> 00:18:09.074
I couldn't stop my sister.
And I couldn't protect you.

00:18:09.158 --> 00:18:13.324
I lied. All I ever did
was deceive you.

00:18:13.408 --> 00:18:14.949
Iris...

00:18:15.033 --> 00:18:16.116
[IRIS whimpers]

00:18:17.783 --> 00:18:20.283
I know you may not believe this,

00:18:20.366 --> 00:18:23.158
but the kindness you
showed me was genuine.

00:18:23.241 --> 00:18:25.866
Even after Dahlia Hawthorne
was found guilty,

00:18:25.949 --> 00:18:28.116
I still believed
in the girl I knew.

00:18:28.199 --> 00:18:32.908
[IRIS whimpers]
I hope you can forgive me...

00:18:32.991 --> 00:18:34.241
...Feenie.

00:18:35.324 --> 00:18:37.241
I knew all along.

00:18:37.324 --> 00:18:40.366
That the person
I fell in love with was real.

00:18:40.449 --> 00:18:43.366
[IRIS whimpers]
Thank you...

00:18:47.158 --> 00:18:49.199
How many cups
of this delicious darkness

00:18:49.283 --> 00:18:53.033
have I drank over the years?
There's no way to know.

00:18:53.116 --> 00:18:55.783
But I'm positive
that of all those mugs,

00:18:55.866 --> 00:18:57.658
this is the most satisfying.

00:19:00.033 --> 00:19:02.741
Wouldn't you agree,
Phoenix Wright?

00:19:02.824 --> 00:19:04.699
So let's toast to closure.

00:19:07.283 --> 00:19:09.449
Yeah. Sounds good to me.

00:19:10.866 --> 00:19:12.074
[JUDGE]
Hmm. Hmm.

00:19:14.241 --> 00:19:16.033
Now, if there are
no further objections,

00:19:16.116 --> 00:19:18.866
I'm ready to hand down
my verdict for Sister Iris.

00:19:20.783 --> 00:19:21.699
Not guilty!

00:19:21.783 --> 00:19:23.616
[CROWD cheers]

00:19:23.699 --> 00:19:25.533
Court is hereby adjourned!

00:19:27.074 --> 00:19:28.616
[PHOENIX]
It's all over, huh?

00:19:28.699 --> 00:19:30.533
Thanks so much for everything!

00:19:30.616 --> 00:19:32.741
I guess it's a lot
like Mia said, isn't it?

00:19:32.824 --> 00:19:33.949
[gasps]

00:19:34.033 --> 00:19:36.324
Yep, that night she
wrote a note back to me.

00:19:36.408 --> 00:19:40.699
It said, "Don't worry, Phoenix
will save everyone in the end."

00:19:40.783 --> 00:19:42.449
She really said that?

00:19:43.866 --> 00:19:45.199
Miles?

00:19:45.283 --> 00:19:46.449
So, uh...

00:19:46.533 --> 00:19:50.116
Listen, Wright. You did well.
Excellent work.

00:19:50.199 --> 00:19:51.574
Thanks, but we both know

00:19:51.658 --> 00:19:53.199
I couldn't have
done it without you.

00:19:53.283 --> 00:19:54.533
[MILES sighs]

00:19:54.616 --> 00:19:55.783
[PHOENIX sighs]

00:19:55.866 --> 00:19:57.824
Face it, you won
the case 'cause of my skills

00:19:57.908 --> 00:19:59.033
as an artiste!

00:19:59.116 --> 00:20:00.824
You can thank
ol' "big" Dick Gumshoe

00:20:00.908 --> 00:20:01.824
while you're at it.

00:20:01.908 --> 00:20:03.491
--[BOTH whimper]
--Fools.

00:20:03.574 --> 00:20:06.241
You should be thankful for
my help, Phoenix Wright.

00:20:06.324 --> 00:20:10.199
For I've brought someone
special from the Inner Temple.

00:20:10.283 --> 00:20:12.158
--Hey, it's Pearls!
--Little Pearl!

00:20:12.241 --> 00:20:15.324
[sobs]
Mystic Maya!

00:20:15.408 --> 00:20:17.908
So why do you have
curry all over you?

00:20:17.991 --> 00:20:21.574
Well, I felt so
bad about the scroll.

00:20:21.658 --> 00:20:23.449
So you went and cleaned it up?

00:20:23.533 --> 00:20:24.866
[PEARL]
Mm-hmm.

00:20:24.949 --> 00:20:28.366
Thank you! But don't
run away and leave me again!

00:20:28.449 --> 00:20:32.158
--[BUTZ sobs]
--[PEARL] Mystic Maya!

00:20:32.241 --> 00:20:35.533
[PHOENIX] Looking at everyone
gathered around, it hit me.

00:20:35.616 --> 00:20:38.366
There was a common thread
woven throughout this case.

00:20:38.449 --> 00:20:41.324
People trying to protect
what was most dear to them.

00:20:41.408 --> 00:20:43.158
But where did I fit into that?

00:20:43.241 --> 00:20:44.699
Did I protect anyone?

00:20:46.283 --> 00:20:48.366
[MIA]
Don't worry, Phoenix.

00:20:48.449 --> 00:20:50.949
You truly saved the day.

00:20:51.033 --> 00:20:52.783
None of these faces
would be smiling now

00:20:52.866 --> 00:20:57.033
if it weren't for you.
You've made me proud.

00:20:57.116 --> 00:21:00.158
[MIA] We'll see each other
again, I'm sure of it.

00:21:00.241 --> 00:21:01.533
[PHOENIX sighs]

00:21:02.908 --> 00:21:04.491
[PHOENIX] How hard will
you fight for the people

00:21:04.574 --> 00:21:06.158
you care about most?

00:21:06.241 --> 00:21:09.324
That's the truest measure
of one's character.

00:21:09.408 --> 00:21:10.991
It's a question
defense attorneys must

00:21:11.074 --> 00:21:13.574
ask themselves while
preparing for battle.

00:21:14.533 --> 00:21:15.783
[PHOENIX]
Although the bonds we share

00:21:15.866 --> 00:21:18.074
are tested from time to time,
in the end,

00:21:18.158 --> 00:21:20.449
these struggles
only bring us closer.

00:21:20.533 --> 00:21:22.491
And I know that my
friends and I would fight

00:21:22.574 --> 00:21:24.449
tooth and nail
for each other.

00:23:06.658 --> 00:23:10.533
Heh. You've come a long way,
Wright. But not far enough.

00:23:10.616 --> 00:23:12.366
Whoa, you hear that, Nick?

00:23:12.449 --> 00:23:13.741
Go get him!

00:23:14.991 --> 00:23:16.283
Objection!
